          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"the-shorthand-and-modeloptions\">The shorthand and <code>ModelOptions</code></h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The shorthand <code>\"provider/model\"</code> selects a provider and a model. It splits at the first <code>/</code> only, so\n<code>\"openrouter/openai/gpt-4o-mini\"</code> is the provider <code>openrouter</code> with the model <code>openai/gpt-4o-mini</code>. <code>ModelOptions</code>\nsets more: the temperature, the output limit, the address of the server and extra headers.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SFPL",
      "code_hash": "c1fff62d0030bf2f1f1a3548f737cec0",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><div class=\"language-scdoc codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code>ModelOptions(provider='openrouter', model='openai/gpt-4o-mini', api_key_env=None, base_url=None, temperature=None, max_output_tokens=None, headers={})\n\nModelOptions(provider='anthropic', model='claude-haiku-4-5', api_key_env=None, base_url=None, temperature=0.2, max_output_tokens=8000, headers={})\n</code></pre></div></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
