            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"openrouter\">OpenRouter</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">One key reaches many models. The free router <code>openrouter/free</code> is the default of EBaMl, and it picks a new model for\neach request. A pinned model gives repeatable results.</span></span>"
