          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"ollama-a-local-model\">Ollama, a local model</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The model runs on your machine and needs no key. Install <a href=\"https://ollama.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Ollama</a>, then run\n<code>ollama pull llama3.1</code> and keep the server running. <code>base_url</code> defaults to <code>http://localhost:11434/v1</code>. If the\nserver is not running, the section shows the error with its fix steps.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
