          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"a-gateway-with-an-openai-compatible-api\">A gateway with an OpenAI-compatible API</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The provider <code>openai-generic</code> talks to any server that follows the OpenAI API: a company gateway, vLLM, LM Studio.\nIt needs <code>base_url</code>. <code>api_key_env</code> names the variable that holds the key of the gateway, and <code>headers</code> adds headers\nto each request. Fill the fields, then press the button.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
