            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"other-providers\">Other providers</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><code>google</code>, <code>azure</code>, <code>vertex</code> and <code>bedrock</code> work the same way. Their keys and settings differ: the table in the\ndocumentation page \"Choosing the model\" lists them.</span>\n<h2 id=\"when-the-setup-is-wrong\">When the setup is wrong</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">EBaMl checks the provider before the first paid request, and it turns the failures that you can fix into errors\nwith fix steps. The two cells below send no request.</span></span>"
